    <briefdescription>
<para><computeroutput>MonHashTable</computeroutput> trait for the resolution engine&apos;s <computeroutput><ref refid="res-monomial-types_8hpp_af33ca331995cea8124ea3653cfbf069d_1af33ca331995cea8124ea3653cfbf069d" kindref="member">res_packed_monomial</ref></computeroutput>s, with components included. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Counterpart of <computeroutput><ref refid="class_monomials_with_component" kindref="compound">MonomialsWithComponent</ref></computeroutput> for the F4 resolution code: combines the per-monomial hash from <computeroutput><ref refid="class_res_monoid_dense_a875824ef5727780a35f7325653c30538_1a875824ef5727780a35f7325653c30538" kindref="member">ResMonoid::hash_value</ref></computeroutput> with a <computeroutput>34141 * component</computeroutput> term so two monomials with the same exponent vector but different components land in different buckets. Equality goes through <computeroutput><ref refid="class_res_monoid_dense_a86f1c57387d2f07d22e42dba106e2455_1a86f1c57387d2f07d22e42dba106e2455" kindref="member">ResMonoid::is_equal</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
